Attribution:
  era labs (ora.ai). (2026). AX Beats AEO dataset: a reproduction sample of agent-journey
  traces, judged accuracy, endorsement, and hedge annotations from the ax-beats-aeo research
  program. era labs. Data released under CC BY 4.0.

The dataset contains machine-recorded observations from agent runs against public product
websites (grounding, cost, and outcome metrics; LLM-judged fact verdicts and recommendation
grades), per-domain accessibility scores and taxonomy labels, and aggregated per-model-generation
results from a separate training-knowledge probe. Raw page content, raw agent traces, and
per-question judge output are not redistributed. Domains are public identifiers.
